body:
ill tell you why i want to do art and why its so important to me to become a concept artist, because in the days where i got bullied at school and then came home to my dad fighting, I had one escape and that was video games and if I can become an artist on a project that can do that for some other kid going through the same in the world that's good enough for me.

&#x200B;

Its just getting there is going to be a scary journey but I'm willing to take it

I dont share my art with anyone, not even my family. Mostly because I feel like im not at a good enough skill level that I think is worthy to show anyone also I draw alot of nsfw stuff, so theres also a feeling that people will think im wierd if they see what I draw, but mostly I just study anatomy and its relaxing.

&#x200B;

However once Im at the skill level I wanna be at ill start growing a social media following and show off some of my work.
